WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.823
Unit twenty-one. Privacy by Design!

2
00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:09.082
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.132 --> 00:00:12.741
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.791 --> 00:00:16.512
Today we learn about Privacy by Design. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.748 --> 00:00:22.915
Privacy by design. Say it with me. Privacy by design!

6
00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:30.534
Personal data. Say it with me. Personal data!

7
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:38.300
Minimize. Say it with me. Minimize!

8
00:00:41.828 --> 00:00:45.519
Consent. Say it with me. Consent!

9
00:00:49.041 --> 00:00:52.874
Encryption. Say it with me. Encryption!

10
00:00:56.357 --> 00:01:00.443
Access. Say it with me. Access!

11
00:01:03.927 --> 00:01:07.421
Delete. Say it with me. Delete!

12
00:01:10.898 --> 00:01:14.315
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

13
00:01:17.859 --> 00:01:29.167
Privacy by design means protecting personal data from the start. Collect the minimum needed, ask for consent, use encryption, limit access, and let users delete their data to build trust.

14
00:01:29.217 --> 00:01:32.641
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:33.931 --> 00:01:39.191
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.241 --> 00:01:40.391
Minimize!

17
00:01:41.514 --> 00:01:46.771
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.821 --> 00:01:47.971
Delete!

19
00:01:48.744 --> 00:01:56.728
Did you know? Privacy by design is a principle included in modern data protection laws such as the EU's GDPR!

20
00:01:56.778 --> 00:01:59.262
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:00.277 --> 00:02:08.082
Think and answer. What data should an app avoid collecting?

22
00:02:08.132 --> 00:02:09.282
Great answer!

23
00:02:10.274 --> 00:02:15.433
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
